U ls
C This command lists all files and directories in your current path.
U cd
C This is a builtin used to change your current working directory.
U pwd
C It stands for 'Print Working Directory' and shows your full current path.
U grep
C This tool searches for text patterns within files or standard input.
U cat
C This command reads files and displays their content on the terminal.
U echo
C It displays a line of text or variables to the standard output.